{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>To roof</b> — from קורות בתינו (the beams of our houses)." "<b>And for the house that I shall enter</b> — this is the king's house. He explained: the house that I shall enter, for the house adjacent to the city wall is the Temple."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:55.550031651Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}